{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Get place"},"description":"One powiat, gmina or village (its codelist and code from podziemie_find_members): the newest value of every published place table for it, each with its period, unit, source line, and its rank among the units of its level or why it has none (villages and places too small to rank have none). An event rate (births, deaths, dwellings per 1,000) is ranked on the mean of its last 3 years, not on its newest value: rankValue gives that mean, rounded as the place page prints it (so places at different ranks can share it), and rankedYears its years. With dataset, that table only, with every stored period of the place and its breaks. A value GUS withholds comes back null, never 0. An abolished unit answers with its end date and no value. Answers not-available until places launch.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"code":{"description":"The place's code in that list, e.g. \"1201\" (powiat), \"1201063\" (gmina) or \"0950463\" (village).","pattern":"^\\d{4}$|^\\d{7}$","type":"string"},"codelist":{"description":"The place list, as podziemie_find_members names it: teryt-powiaty (powiat), teryt-gminy (gmina, TERC with its type digit) or simc-miejscowosci (village).","enum":["teryt-powiaty","teryt-gminy","simc-miejscowosci"],"type":"string"},"dataset":{"description":"One place table from values[].dataset: answers that table only, with every stored period of the place.","maxLength":80,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["codelist","code"],"type":"object"},"name":"podziemie_get_place","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"code":{"type":"string"},"codelist":{"type":"string"},"hint":{"type":"string"},"history":{"additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"breaks":{"items":{"additionalPropert